        "original_id": "35a7eb64-caaf-5b17-99c4-4b68db1335b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: British protectorate, Zimbabwe, Zambia, Zambezi River\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: colonial history, borders\n\nFacts:\n- Cecil Rhodes founded the territory that later became a former British protectorate.\n- The former British protectorate later became two countries: Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- The Zambezi River became the border between Zimbabwe and Zambia.\n- Zimbabwe lies south of the Zambezi River.\n- Zambia lies north of the Zambezi River.",
